Nothing third-party is redistributed here. Host binaries are installed from the
platform's own package manager or, for UAC and Velociraptor, from a pinned release
download that an image build checks against the sha256 in requires/host.json, and
Python packages from PyPI (this pack asks for none), so each carries its own
licence and none of them travels inside this pack. CyLR is declared and is not
installed in any image.
